  "Id": 1688,
  "Title": "A Symposium on Orbital Cancer: Recent Advances",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "A symposium was held at CIME with an aim to spread awareness about the latest techniques in treating orbital cancer. All day of the scientific programme was dedicated to multidisciplinary sessions.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassFF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<style>\nFF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 p.MsoNormal, FF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 li.MsoNormal, FF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 div.MsoNormal {\nmargin-top:0cm;\nmargin-right:0cm;\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;\nmargin-left:0cm;\nline-height:107%;\nfont-size:11.0pt;\nfont-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\n}\n\nFF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 .MsoChpDefault {\nfont-size:11.0pt;\nfont-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\n}\n\nFF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 .MsoPapDefault {\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;\nline-height:107%;\n}\n\nFF90D7D8A2884520955284602A538071 div.WordSection1 {\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;\">This was\nheld successfully on July 16, 2018. The aim was to spread awareness about the latest\ntechniques in treating orbital cancer. 60 participants attended this multidisciplinary\nscientific programme organised by AKU Ophthalmology in collaboration with\nRadiation and Paediatric Oncology departments.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;\">Internationally,\nProf. Gyorgy Kovacs, Director, Interdisciplinary Brachytherapy Unit and Prof.\nof Radiation Oncology from Luebeck University, Germany distinguished the event.\nThree international expert lectures via Zoom video conference provided depth to\nthe proceedings&#58; two from UK and one from Spain, harnessing the power of\ncommunications technologies in CIME. <span>&#160;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;\">The\nparticipants, international &amp; national speakers spoke very highly of the\norganization,<span>&#160; </span>and scientific content of\nthe event. It is planned to repeat this important academic activity annually.</span></p><br></div>",
